{"id":"rac3m19834lm7ffcdnct5wv1w","title":"AI时代如何保持独立思考——从《自然》的讨论谈批判性思维培养","originalTitle":null,"summary":"《自然》发表专题文章讨论生成式AI对批判性思维的影响，指出AI虽能提高任务表现，但可能削弱学生独立思考能力。研究发现，依赖AI的学生在撤除AI后表现更差，强调批判性思维需结合知识积累与主动思考。文章提出培养批判性思维的方法，包括培养元认知、信息核查、主动解释和保留认知努力。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3658560&do=blog&id=1560164"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-07T10:40:04.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T15:20:11.725Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T15:20:11.725Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":48,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}